{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20295","headline":"车遥遥 · 张籍","name":"车遥遥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征人遥遥出古城，双轮齐动驷马鸣。\n山川无处不归路，念君长作万里行。\n野田人稀秋草绿，日暮放马车中宿。\n惊麏游兔在我傍，独唱乡歌对僮仆。\n君家大宅凤城隅，年年道上随行车。\n愿爲玉銮系华轼，终日有声在君侧。\n门前旧辙久已平，无由复得君消息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}